---
layout: layouts/product.njk
title: "Caller Lookup"
description: "CNAM and caller-ID lookup services for inbound screening, customer-service display, routing, and fraud controls."
---
{%- from "partials/v2/macros.njk" import arrow %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
	"@context": "https://schema.org",
	"@type": "Service",
	"serviceType": "CNAM and caller-ID lookup",
	"name": "VoiceTel Caller Lookup",
	"provider": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "{{ site.brand }}", "url": "{{ site.url }}" },
	"areaServed": ["US", "CA"],
	"url": "{{ site.url }}/caller-lookup/",
	"description": "CNAM and caller-ID enrichment for inbound screening, customer-service display, routing decisions, and fraud controls. Real-time API with batch options."
}
</script>

<section class="hero hero--page" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
	<div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="container hero__inner">
		<div class="hero__copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">Caller Lookup</p>
			<h1 id="hero-heading">Caller-name data for routing, display, and screening.</h1>
			<p class="lede">Caller Lookup gives applications and operators a way to enrich phone numbers with CNAM and caller-ID information before a call is answered, routed, or presented to an agent.</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/pricing/#lookup-cnam">See pricing {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/docs/api/">Read API docs</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hero__visual">
			{%- set code %}{% highlight "bash" %}curl -X POST https://api.voicetel.com/v2.1/info/cnam/ \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "apikey": "YOUR_API_KEY",
    "cid": 2015551234
  }'{% endhighlight %}{% endset %}
			{%- set terminal = { label: "cnam-lookup.sh", pill: "POST /v2.1/info/cnam", code: code } %}
			{% include "partials/v2/terminal.njk" %}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="cnam" aria-labelledby="cnam-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="row__text">
				<p class="eyebrow">Why CNAM</p>
				<h2 id="cnam-heading">CNAM-enriched lookup, not just LERG.</h2>
				<p class="lede">A LERG-only lookup tells you which carrier the number routes through. CNAM tells you the business name on the caller-ID record, which is what the agent or the application actually needs. VoiceTel blends CNAM, LERG, and portability data into a single query so you don't have to make three calls per inbound.</p>
				<p class="row__links">Full reference: <a href="{{ apiSpecs['v2.2'].urlPath }}#operation/cnamLookup">VoiceTel API v2.2 &rsaquo; CNAM lookup</a>.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="row__visual">
				{%- set rows = [
					{ title: "CNAM", meta: "business name on the caller-ID record", state: "Included" },
					{ title: "LERG", meta: "which carrier the number routes through", state: "Included" },
					{ title: "Portability", meta: "ported-number context", state: "Included" },
					{ title: "Queries per inbound call", meta: "one blended lookup, not three", state: "1", neutral: true }
				] %}
				{% include "partials/v2/status-card.njk" %}
			</div>
		</div>

		<h3 class="subsection-heading">Use cases</h3>
		{%- set featureHeading = "h4" %}
		{%- set features = [
			{ icon: "person-vcard", title: "Agent screen pop", body: "Display a caller name in CRM or helpdesk workflows before the conversation starts." },
			{ icon: "shield-check", title: "Inbound screening", body: "Use caller identity as one signal in spam, fraud, and escalation decisions." },
			{ icon: "diagram-3", title: "Routing context", body: "Route known business callers, customers, or anonymous callers into different queues or workflows." },
			{ icon: "layers", title: "Batch hygiene", body: "Run lists through batch lookup before a campaign, migration, or data-cleanup project." }
		] %}
		{% include "partials/v2/feature-grid.njk" %}

		<div class="cta-band">
			<div class="cta-band__text">
				<h3 class="cta-band__title">Run 100 numbers through it.</h3>
				<p class="cta-band__body">Send a batch of test numbers through the API. See the data quality, latency, and unit cost on your own real numbers before integrating.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cta-band__actions cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/signup/">Sign up {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/docs/api/">Read API docs</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
